{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The concept of the game is to fill a grid with the numbers 1-9 ensuring no repetition across rows or columns.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players move to the empty cells in the grid and choose a number to go in that cell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If players get stuck on a particular puzzle, a Hint system is available to get them back on track. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play continues until the board is filled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Pencil icon allows the player to make pencil marks in the square to make notes and narrow down their choices. This isn\u2019t counted as their answer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Eraser icon allows the player to rub out a previous answer if they later realise it\u2019s not correct.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Undo icon allows the player to undo one or more moves. This doesn\u2019t roll back the game timer.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Difficulty</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is available in four difficulty levels:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Easy<br>- Medium<br>- Hard<br>- Extreme</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Beginner mode, players can make an unlimited amount of mistakes, compared to the normal mode where only a handful of errors can be made before its GAME OVER!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Challenges</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game will contain a Daily Challenge function where players can battle against other players all over the world to get the fastest time.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game consists of a set number of levels in each difficulty level - completing all will win the game.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Leaderboards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game also includes leaderboards to allow players to rank amongst their friends and the world. Leaderboards will be progression and time based.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"My First Sudoku","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamsta